{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fUO0rbL8WX1795088027.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》今晚（19日）隆重舉行，紅地氈環節於下午5時45分正式揭幕！全台逾200位藝員盛裝打扮出席，齊齊歡度TVB 59周年台慶，現場星光熠熠，氣氛相當熱烈。</p><p></p><p>今屆大會司儀陣容同樣鼎盛，由汪明荃（阿姐）領軍，聯同林溥來、朱凱婷、周奕瑋、洪永城、黃翠如、陸浩明、麥美恩、鄭衍峰、林秀怡、孔德賢及潘靜文，合共12位司儀強勢坐鎮，攜手帶領觀眾投入整晚台慶盛況。</p><p><p><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-19 at 19.31.13.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202637hnJQYbwT1795087925.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-19 at 19.30.52.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CvyK91ojOH1795087924.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-19 at 19.31.29.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iknzmwD7bk1795087924.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-19 at 19.31.19.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SHklmOfgPW1795087925.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4430.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026feoJicStd11795084746.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4357.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BKlSht9aFV1795084742.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4386.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026X0qN0Uo3po1795084745.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D4392.jpg\" decoding=\"a